{'symbol': 'PNC', 'date': '2021-04-07 09:11:00', 'title': 'HARRIS WILLIAMS ADVISES AIT WORLDWIDE LOGISTICS ON ITS RECAPITALIZATION BY THE JORDAN COMPANY', 'text': 'RICHMOND, VA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HARRIS WILLIAMS, A GLOBAL INVESTMENT BANK SPECIALIZING IN M&A ADVISORY SERVICES, ANNOUNCES IT ADVISED AIT WORLDWIDE LOGISTICS (AIT), A PORTFOLIO COMPANY OF QUAD-C MANAGEMENT (QUAD-C), ON ITS SALE TO THE JORDAN COMPANY (TJC) IN A RECAPITALIZATION VALUED AT OVER $1.2 BILLION. AIT PRESIDENT AND CEO VAUGHN MOORE AND HIS SENIOR TEAM WILL CONTINUE TO LEAD THE BUSINESS AND WILL REMAIN SIGNIFICANT INVESTORS IN AIT. AIT IS A LEADING NON-ASSET-BASED GLOBAL FREIGHT FORW'}